================================================================================
CORPUS DATA
================================================================================

research/scores.csv and research/engagement.csv contain model-derived scores and
publicly-visible engagement counts for 24 public YouTube videos by third-party
creators, retained for reproducibility of the reported correlation analysis.
No video content, audio, transcripts, or frames are redistributed in this
repository. Engagement figures were publicly visible at collection time and are
point-in-time snapshots, not a live feed.
